# Allowlist: the image gets only what the API needs, plus the win model's card. Everything
# else, including .env (secrets) and data/ (CHN data, personal use only), never enters the build.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!config/
!src/
!db/
!.streamlit/
!models/*.json

# and nothing generated inside those
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
